      "content": "# Oreflow — architecture (why / what / how)\n\n**Why:** field units drop scan exports in many shapes; downstream analytics needs one\nnormalized schema. Oreflow is the seam that absorbs that variety.\n\n**What:** a small ingestion service — readers per source format, a normalizer, and a\nwriter to the analytics bucket.\n\n**How:** `app/services/ingest.py` orchestrates; `app/services/auth.py` fetches the\nupstream token; `app/utils/io.py` handles read/write. Auth currently uses a static\nservice token (tech debt — see notes-old.md).\n"
